      {
        "id": "trigger-basic_attack-silenced_shot",
        "name": "Silenced Shot (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "Hold [BASIC] to activate:\n\nTrigger enters the /bSniper Stance//b and fires forward continuously, dealing Electric DMG.\n\nWhile continually firing, when attacked by an enemy, Trigger will automatically evade. This effect can trigger once every 8s. While continually firing, you can drag the stick/joystick to adjust her position to the left/right/back.\n\nAutomatically evading attacks or adjusting position when about to be hit will trigger a /bPerfect Dodge//b, followed by an automatic charged counter.\n\nAfter releasing [BASIC], Trigger will step back, ready her weapon and unleash a /bFinishing Move//b, then exit /bSniper Stance//b. Character is invulnerable during the charged counter and /bFinishing Move//b. When the continuous firing or the charged counter hits an enemy, Trigger gains 25 /bPurge//b, up to a maximum of 100 /bPurge//b.\n\nWhen the /bFinishing Move//b hits an enemy, it triggers the /bQuick Assist//b of the previous character in the squad. A /bQuick Assist//b can only be triggered through this method once every 25s.",
